boot_dl_p8_0.bin is an M16C download-mode test program (it toggles port
pin P8_0 in a loop) used by the `download` command to probe the bootloader's
0xFA download-to-RAM-and-execute feature.

It is taken unmodified from the m16c-flasher project:
  https://github.com/truhy/m16c-flasher  (sourcecode/scripts_linux/boot_dl_p8_0.bin)

m16c-flasher is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2023 Truong Hy. The MIT license
text is in that repository's LICENSE file.
